ong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1262303-monday-meeting-22-10-2018?p=1262343#post1262343\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do they tend to do Kickstarters regularly (like 1 every 2 months or something), or just whenever? I don't really pay attention to Onyx Path's other stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>It shakes out about five-six Kickstarters a year; they try for one every two months, but it doesn't necessarily work out like that, thanks to delays and such.<br /> <br /> With this block in particular, things are a bit uncertain; Chicago by Night is still at WW for approvals, and if it's not cleared in time for the tentative KS start, October 30th, that'll impact the others, as we're coming up on Christmas. They can just about manage They Came! over Christmas if Chicago by Night ends in November, but if not it'll probably bump to January.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":51,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","user":"marin","date":". 10-23-2018, 09:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}